    "faiss_compatibility_adapter": "The upstream Torch-tensor Faiss IndexFlatIP search segfaulted in the mixed Apple arm64 CPU runtime. The exact pinned index vectors are reconstructed in a separate FAISS-only process; NumPy float32 inner-product search reproduces FAISS top-1 IDs and scores for four deterministic equivalence queries per index. No embeddings, reference vectors, thresholds, models, or preprocessing are changed."
  },
